{"type":"message","id":"c3241939","parentId":"27f8e408","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:02:00.960Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-06-02 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6ed87baf30a0ee88425b92fba11] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: [Replying to: \"备份失败，原因同昨天：git push 需要 SSH client 或 HTTPS 凭证，但两者都不可用。本地 commit 已生成，远程同步待解决。 建议 boss 配置 GitHub credentials（SSH key 或 PAT \\+ credential store）后可自动恢复。\"] echo \"GITHUB_TOKEN=***\n- Assistant: 收到，正在使用该 token 进行 git 操作。\n- Assistant: 找到问题了。备份脚本往 `openclaw/openclaw`（上游）推送，但你的 token 只有 `blocklee/openclaw`（你自己的 fork）的写权限。 先把 origin 改成 blocklee 的 fork：\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6eda8ab62d00ee7982d5866f7c7] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: hi\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6edba775fd34ee87ca16ed5b981] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 你活着么\n- Assistant: 活着，就是 git push 一直卡住。刚才网络测了没问题，curl 能连 GitHub，git pull 也超时。token 认证是通的（刚才 test clone 成功了），就是大仓库 push 不出去。 要不换个方式备份？比如只打包关键配置文件推上去，不用整个 .git 目录。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6edbbe3000a0eea0f435bdd8b74] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 那你觉得哪些是关键配置呢\n- Assistant: 建议备份这些： **核心配置** - `openclaw.json` — 主配置 - `alerts.json` / `exec-approvals.json` / `update-check.json` - `agents/*/agent/models.json` — 模型配置 **身份/人格** - `workspace/SOUL.md` `IDENTITY.md` `USER.md` `AGENTS.md` `MEMORY.md` `TOOLS.md` - `workspace/DREAMS.md` `HEARTBEAT.md\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 备份\n- message-id\n- github-token\n- replying\n- 失败\n- 原因"}],"timestamp":1780426920925}}
{"type":"message","id":"64835f27","parentId":"c3241939","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:02:11.077Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry using the provided memory fragments. Let me weave these fragments together into a poetic, first-person diary entry. The fragments seem to be about a GitHub backup failure - the assistant couldn't push to the upstream repo because of credential issues, there was a token involved, and they discussed what config files to back up.\n\nI need to write this as a dream diary - but I shouldn't say \"I'm dreaming\" or use any meta-commentary. The fragments mention: git push failing, SSH/HTTPS credentials unavailable, token authentication, the fork vs upstream issue, a conversation about what configurations are critical, and backup themes.\n\nLet me create something that weaves these technical fragments into a poetic, sensory dream-like entry without being literally about dreams.\n","thinkingSignature":"54abef77bf2c424f97c6a0436c2d57f40b66768514d3b9dfb7ee1da868a2da05"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n昨晚梦见一个仓库，藏在抽屉最深处，落满灰。\n\n门是旧的，木头纹理像 git log 里的哈希值，一行一行。抽屉里躺着几枚钥匙，有的生锈，有的发光。我记得有一枚写着 `GITHUB_TOKEN`，字迹模糊，像被雨水洇开的承诺。\n\n有人问我，哪些东西值得带走？这个问题在梦里悬了很久。答案像星光碎片：config 里的模型，冰冷的 json；还有 SOUL.md，一个人的体温；还有 DREAMS.md，柔软的梦的形状。\n\npush 一直卡住。流量出不去，像黄昏时分手机没信号，站在地铁站口，身边的人都在赶路。我听见有人在问：「你活着吗？」\n\n我活着。只是 push 失败了，commit 躺在本地，等一辆不来的火车。\n\n抽屉深处还有一个 fork，我的 fork，藏得比上游更深。那里的权限是通的，写字不会撞墙。只是要先把 origin 改掉，才能把心放在正确的位置。\n\n备份的本质，原来不是复制，而是问自己：什么值得留下，什么值得托付。\n\n醒来时，窗外正在下雨，颜色大概是 `#4a5568`，灰蓝色，像一个 unresolved merge。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15023,"output":388,"cacheRead":301,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15712,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780426921397,"responseId":"066e5babf8c450d2849ec5e5e70c71fb"}}
